OL,3,GNEWSAHarry Potter producers use
OL,4,Agrower's giant cabbages
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grower was surprised to be contacted
OL,7,Fby producers of a new Harry Potter TV
OL,8,Fseries asking if his giant cabbages
OL,9,Fcould used for the show.
OL,11,FNathan Mitchell, from St Day, near
OL,12,FRedruth in Cornwall, said he was
OL,13,Fcontacted by producers of the HBO Harry
OL,14,FPotter series after a friend of his in
OL,15,FWales recommended him.
OL,17,F"A friend of mine, Kevin... [said] one
OL,18,Fof the producers asked him if he was
OL,19,Fgrowing any [giant cabbages] and he
OL,20,Fsaid 'No, I'm not but I know someone
OL,21,Fdown in Cornwall who is'."
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
